<h1>Guide Snapshot: The Fast Answer</h1>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Custom compostable packaging is made-to-order packaging
designed to replace conventional plastic while improving brand presentation.
For most ecommerce brands, the most practical first step is a custom
compostable mailer: branded, waterproof, durable, and suitable for regular
dispatch.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>This guide is written for brands that want a practical=
 way
to assess whether custom compostable packaging is commercially viable,
operationally realistic, and credible enough to support their sustainability
claims.</p>

<h2>How to Use This Guide</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Start with Sections 1 to 4 if you are still comparing
packaging options. Go to Sections 7, 11, 12 and 15 if you are close to
requesting a quote. Use Sections 9 and 10 before making any public
environmental claims about your packaging.</p>

