<h2>Made to Order</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Custom compostable packaging is produced in response t=
o a
specific order rather than held as pre-made stock. This means each producti=
on
run is created to your dimensions, print specifications, and quantity
requirements.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Made-to-order production has implications for lead tim=
es and
minimum order quantities, both of which are covered later in this guide. The
key point is that custom packaging requires planning &#8212; it is not the =
same
as ordering a box of generic stock mailers for next-day delivery.</p>

<h2>What Custom Compostable Packaging Is Not</h2>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>It is worth being clear about what this category of
packaging does not include:</p>

